# No em-dashes

Never use em-dashes (`—`) anywhere: not in UI copy, metadata, code comments,
docs, or commit messages. Em-dashes read as AI-generated.

Use a comma, colon, period, or parentheses instead. This is a hard rule and
applies to every file, including regenerated Framer components.
